Source: pg-describe
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/sajonaro/pg_describe

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pg-describe
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-pg-describe
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Describe query parameters and result columns without execution
 pg_describe reports query parameters and result columns without executing the
 query, including type, name, provenance, and nullability information.
